WEBVTT

00:08:59.796 --> 00:09:01.076
Ignite.

00:09:01.396 --> 00:09:05.996
Remind everybody watching
that you are not powerless.

00:09:06.316 --> 00:09:08.516
That, "Ah man, there's nothing we can do,

00:09:08.516 --> 00:09:09.676
just keep going."

00:09:09.716 --> 00:09:11.916
is a symptom,

00:09:11.916 --> 00:09:13.076
not cure.

00:09:13.996 --> 00:09:17.956
That you stand on years
worth of resistance and success,

00:09:17.956 --> 00:09:19.596
that you are needed.

00:09:20.516 --> 00:09:23.796
That you, just like my mum,

00:09:23.796 --> 00:09:27.316
have the power to reimagine

00:09:27.356 --> 00:09:28.996
what you think is possible.